  "title": "Stuffed Zucchini Casserole",
  "description": "For this stuffed zucchini casserole recipe, scooped-out zucchini halves are stuffed with ground beef, sausage, onion, and egg, then baked in a tomato sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "BUCHKO"
  ],
